      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits where the Loup River meets the Platte, about 85 miles west‑northwest of Omaha and 75 miles northwest of Lincoln.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Columbus%2C_Nebraska",
